    {
      "id": 11204,
      "name": "peterrecore",
      "username": "peterrecore",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b77776/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-31T22:16:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The second Ongoing Ability on Bunker's Turret Mode card states that \"Bunker cannot Dodge, Move, or Be Moved.\"</p><p>How does this differ from Omnitron's Character Panel that says Omnitron-V is \"Immune to Push\"?&nbsp;<span>In particular:</span></p><ul>\n<li><span>Does getting Pushed count as \"Being Moved\"?</span></li>\n<li><span>Is there some effect that could cause Omnitron to Be Moved, but not Turret Mode Bunker?</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>If it matters, the specific context that made me ponder this is Bunker being in range of an Impulsion Turret, while in Turret Mode.</span></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:27.297Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 2,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 10.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 11201,
      "topic_slug": "how-does-immune-to-push-differ-from-cannot-be-moved-immense-frame-vs-turret-mode",
      "display_username": "peterrecore",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": true,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>The second Ongoing Ability on Bunker&#39;s Turret Mode card states that &quot;Bunker cannot Dodge, Move, or Be Moved.&quot;</p><p>How does this differ from Omnitron&#39;s Character Panel that says Omnitron-V is &quot;Immune to Push&quot;?&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">In particular:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Does getting Pushed count as &quot;Being Moved&quot;?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Is there some effect that could cause Omnitron to Be Moved, but not Turret Mode Bunker?</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">If it matters, the specific context that made me ponder this is Bunker being in range of an Impulsion Turret, while in Turret Mode.</span></p>",
      "actions_summary": [],
      "moderator": false,
      "admin": false,
      "staff": false,
      "user_id": 9867,
      "hidden": false,
      "trust_level": 1,
      "deleted_at": null,
      "user_deleted": false,
      "edit_reason": null,
      "can_view_edit_history": true,
      "wiki": false,
      "can_accept_answer": false,
      "can_unaccept_answer": false,
      "accepted_answer": false,
      "topic_accepted_answer": false
